  {"rule_id":"de_tianyi","module":"digital_energy","priority":100,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"dominantStar","operator":"eq","value":"天医"}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"天医主事"},{"type":"set_score","field":"wealth_score","value":85},{"type":"generate_text","template":"天医星主导此号码，正财运旺盛，适合从事稳定的正职工作。婚姻美满，身体健康。天医为土，土生金，对投资也有帮助。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_shengqi","module":"digital_energy","priority":100,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"dominantStar","operator":"eq","value":"生气"}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"生气主事"},{"type":"set_score","field":"people_score","value":85},{"type":"generate_text","template":"生气星主导此号码，贵人运旺盛，人缘极好，充满活力。适合从事需要人际交往的行业，容易获得他人帮助。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_yannian","module":"digital_energy","priority":100,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"dominantStar","operator":"eq","value":"延年"}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"延年主事"},{"type":"set_score","field":"career_score","value":80},{"type":"generate_text","template":"延年星主导此号码，事业有成，领导能力强。适合管理岗位或自主创业。身体健康，寿命绵长。金性刚强，决策果断。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_fuwei","module":"digital_energy","priority":100,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"dominantStar","operator":"eq","value":"伏位"}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"伏位主事"},{"type":"set_score","field":"stable_score","value":70},{"type":"generate_text","template":"伏位星主导此号码，宜静不宜动，适合等待时机、积蓄力量。当前阶段不宜冒进，稳中求进为上策。木性柔韧，需耐心。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_jueming","module":"digital_energy","priority":100,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"dominantStar","operator":"eq","value":"绝命"}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"绝命主事"},{"type":"set_score","field":"risk_score","value":15},{"type":"generate_text","template":"绝命星主导此号码，投资风险高，需防破财和意外血光。建议避免高风险投资，注意出行安全。金性过刚易折，建议搭配天医数字化解。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_wugui","module":"digital_energy","priority":100,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"dominantStar","operator":"eq","value":"五鬼"}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"五鬼主事"},{"type":"set_score","field":"risk_score","value":20},{"type":"generate_text","template":"五鬼星主导此号码，需防突发变故和官非口舌。性格多变，情绪易波动。建议保持心态稳定，避免冲动决策。火性过旺，建议搭配生气数字化解。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_liusha","module":"digital_energy","priority":100,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"dominantStar","operator":"eq","value":"六煞"}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"六煞主事"},{"type":"set_score","field":"relation_score","value":35},{"type":"generate_text","template":"六煞星主导此号码，桃花旺盛但多劫扰，人际关系需谨慎处理。情绪波动较大，需自我调控。水性多情，建议搭配延年数字稳定情感。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_huohai","module":"digital_energy","priority":100,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"dominantStar","operator":"eq","value":"祸害"}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"祸害主事"},{"type":"set_score","field":"risk_score","value":25},{"type":"generate_text","template":"祸害星主导此号码，需防口舌是非和小人暗算。注意身体健康，尤其是消化系统。土性厚重，建议搭配天医数字化解。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_zero_multi","module":"digital_energy","priority":95,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"zeroPairs","operator":"gte","value":2}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"多零潜伏"},{"type":"set_score","field":"risk_score","value":30},{"type":"generate_text","template":"号码中存在2组以上0-组合，0的能量大量潜伏，整体号码能量被显著压制。0如同\"能量静音器\"——吉星被减力约50%，虽有天赋但难以发挥。建议在号码关键位置添加1、6、8等能量数字以激活被压制的能量。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_zero_single","module":"digital_energy","priority":90,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"zeroPairs","operator":"gte","value":1}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"含零潜伏"},{"type":"set_score","field":"stable_score","value":40},{"type":"generate_text","template":"号码中含0-组合，部分能量受到0的压制而处于潜伏状态。0使相邻数字的能量无法充分发挥，如同\"明珠蒙尘\"。建议通过佩戴金属饰品（金克木破0之滞）或保持积极行动（以动破静）来激活被压制的能量。"}]},
  {"rule_id":"de_five_mixed","module":"digital_energy","priority":90,"conditions":{"operator":"AND","rules":[{"field":"fivePairs","operator":"gte","value":1}]},"actions":[{"type":"set_tag","value":"含五显化"},{"type":"set_score","field":"stable_score","value":55},{"type":"generate_text","template":"号码中含5-组合，5为显化之数，能够放大相邻数字的能量。这是一把双刃剑——若5放大的是吉星则更加兴旺，若放大的是凶星则更加不利。需结合具体相邻数字判断吉凶。"}]}
